--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_FullLevel_AuxLevelOne_finite_and_natCard_dvd_of_eq_closure_isLevelAutAt_gamma_of_dvd.lean

